# Build artifacts never belong in git - code only. Everything below is PRODUCED by
# `dotnet build` + the release packaging step and is reproducible from source, so
# committing it just bloats history with binaries that change every single release.
# Authored assets (Icons/*.png, HexiumDist/icon.png) are source and DO stay tracked.
*.zip
HexiumDist/plugins/*.dll
